---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/vault-pipeline-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/vault-pipeline-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={640}
  caption="Everything writes through one spine, and a job that fails writes a row to the same log the surfaces read."
>
  Signal sources (iMessage, Gmail, Amazon, calendar, sensors, git) feed seven
  launchd schedules running about forty scripts. The scripts write hash-fenced
  blocks into people and project pages and append events to Activity Log.md,
  the append-only spine. A job that fails writes a deduplicated error row into
  that same log; the toast is a courtesy. The dashboard, daily note, podcast,
  and standup all read from the spine and the fenced blocks.
</Diagram>
